            "feedback-005",
            "feedback-007"
          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "other",
          "statement": "Abrupt shifts from bright cute characters to grotesque cartoon blood, disturbing imagery and psychological unease are the defining atmosphere; players praise the originality while others find the horror unpleasant rather than engaging.",
          "sentiment": "mixed",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
          "mention_count": 5,
          "evidence_languages": [
            "russian",
